{"id":"pozvolit_","lemma":"позволить","pos":"verb","rank":491,"glosses":["to allow, to permit","to afford (often as позволить себе)","excuse (me), sorry, pardon (me) (used to express objection, disagreement or reminding of some fact)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/33/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"позволю","2s":"позволишь","3s":"позволит","1p":"позволим","2p":"позволите","3p":"позволят"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"позволь","2p":"позвольте"}}},"past":{"m":"позволил","p":"позволили","f":"позволила","n":"позволило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"позволять","examples":[{"text":"Позвольте мне остаться.","en":"Permit me to stay.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to remain, to stay"}]},{"text":"Мы можем себе это сейчас позволить?","en":"Can we afford it now?","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"now"},null]},{"text":"Позволь мне рассказать тебе об этом случае.","en":"Let me tell you about the case.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/72594","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"to tell"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"about"},null,null]},{"text":"Я позволю это.","en":"I'll allow it.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Кто вам позволил это делать?","en":"Who gave you permission to do that?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]}]}